{"id":"n14554-1-7","stage":5,"title":"가쁘다 · 紧促","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14554-1-7-1","ko":"요즘은 조금만 걸어도 숨이 가빠.","zh":"最近哪怕只走一点路，也会喘不过气来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘은","audio":"/audio/e48ea92a2eef5b38ed37.mp3"}},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금만","audio":"/audio/61e4375f0847dd284eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"걸어도","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어도","audio":"/audio/753d04879119af015027.mp3"}},{"text":"숨이","meaning":"呼吸","explanation":"숨：呼吸；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"숨","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62463","senseId":"1","lemma":"숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숨이","audio":"/audio/baf87ee2aabf6a9dc1ef.mp3"}},{"text":"가빠.","meaning":"紧促，急促","explanation":"가쁘다：紧促，急促；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가쁘다","audio":"/audio/127a71175f99b254aa4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14554","senseId":"1","lemma":"가쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가빠","audio":"/audio/54d12602dde03c390df7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"19b65768173f5897","term":"숨","zh":"呼吸","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3","entryId":"62463","definition":"人或动物通过鼻子或嘴吸入和呼出空气的行为。","pronunciation":["숨ː"]},{"id":"127a71175f99b254","term":"가쁘다","zh":"紧促，急促","audio":"/audio/127a71175f99b254aa4d.mp3","entryId":"14554","definition":"呼吸速度很快，到了呼吸困难的程度。","pronunciation":["가쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ad9def25d8b9a2e5e66.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14554-1-7-2","ko":"운동이 부족해서 그래. 산책이라도 좀 해.","zh":"是因为运动太少了。至少去散散步吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동이","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동이","audio":"/audio/f9764d1081d03a9455b1.mp3"}},{"text":"부족해서","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","explanation":"부족하다：不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"부족하다","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59849","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부족해서","audio":"/audio/3c5164642e5d40f5f97b.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"산책이라도","meaning":"散步","explanation":"산책：散步；이라도：退而求其次地举出选择，或表示“哪怕、即使”。","readings":[{"term":"산책","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62506","senseId":"1","lemma":"산책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산책이라도","audio":"/audio/3a6a15386872b459f6f0.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"3dd9c5f65c6da41a","term":"부족하다","zh":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3","entryId":"59849","definition":"未能达到需要的数量或基准，不充裕。","pronunciation":["부조카다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"b745d43721954853","term":"산책","zh":"散步","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3","entryId":"62506","definition":"为了稍作休息或身体健康而在附近慢慢地走路。","pronunciation":["산ː책"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f72e32fbc2b530e86f2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.264,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14554","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"htt